{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10294060","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10294060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029406001:1":{"text":"무, 무슨 짓이냐! 왜 앞을 막아서는 거야!","source_cn":"你、你们想干什么！怎么拦着人不让走呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A00D58B3DCBD3B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029406002:1":{"text":"맞아 맞아, 우린 아무것도 안 했는데, 왜 못 나가게 해?","source_cn":"就是就是，我们根本什么都没做，凭什么不让我们离开？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF243978F9F6BEB0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029406003:1":{"text":"아무것도 안 했는데, 왜 그렇게 안절부절못하는 거죠? 또 뭔가 꾸미고 있는 건가요?","source_cn":"要是真没做什么，你们这么心虚干什么？你们是不是又有什么阴谋？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DA6C50D9E481D2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029406004:1":{"text":"우린 그냥 평범한 상인이야! 이동 명령을 받아서 다른 곳으로 장사하러 가는 것뿐이라고! 뭐가 이상해?","source_cn":"我们都是正经商人而已！只不过接到了调令，去别的地方做生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA37C10055C6D769","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029406005:1":{"text":"맞아 맞아! 지금 영지를 청소하면서 빠뜨린 상품이 있나 검사하는 중이었다고!","source_cn":"对啊对啊，我们现在正在打扫营地，检查遗漏的货物而已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FB71FE51BCB5CAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docu